      "value": "<p>You have been trained in the use of warp rounds. Using two actions, you can modify your ammunition to gain the following features:</p><p>Rounds infused with destabilizing dark energy. Your weapon attacks deal an additional <strong>1d4 void damage</strong>.</p><p>Warp rounds are devastating against biotic barriers: damage to a Biotic Barrier is multiplied by 1.5×. Depleting a barrier with Warp rounds triggers a dark energy detonation.</p><p>Remove this effect to return to standard ammunition.</p>"
